  "name": "Trapped!",
  "author": "your_mom",
  "description": "** This map has a special set of rules!\nRead carefully before playing. **\n\n\n~GE is controlled by a human.\n~OS and BM cannot attack GE units.\n~GE moves the Oozium in one area to the other side. After moving them, GE moves the subs to the other lock and repeats the process on the other side.\n~This process of trapping and destroying continues for the entire game.\n~OS and BM cannot place units on the ports.\n~After either OS+BM wins, GE yields.\n~FOW is on, all other settings optional.\n\nIn other words, you must move fast before your units are caught and then destroyed. Capturing the center bases give you Piperunners, but the bases will be useless at some times while the Oozium sit on them. Move fast, and don't get caught!",
